<h1>Domain Verified! ✅</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>Great news! Your custom domain <strong>{{domain}}</strong> has been successfully verified. DNS ownership has been confirmed.</p>

<h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 24px;">What's happening now:</h2>
<ul class="bullet-list">
  <li><strong>SSL Certificate:</strong> An SSL certificate is being automatically provisioned for your domain.</li>
  <li><strong>Activation:</strong> Your domain will be fully active within 2-5 minutes.</li>
  <li><strong>Notification:</strong> You'll receive another email once your domain is live and ready to use.</li>
</ul>

<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/settings/domain" class="btn">Check Domain Status 🔄</a>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888;">SSL certificates are provisioned automatically via Google Cloud. No further action is required from you.</p>
